<title>UK: NatWest may curb NatWest Markets plan - FT.</title>
<headline>NatWest may curb NatWest Markets plan - FT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's National Westminster Bank Plc is considering scaling back plans for growth at its NatWest Markets investment banking unit, the Financial Times newspaper said on Monday.</p>
<p>The unsourced report said NatWest was carrying out a review following the loss of 77 million stg on options within NatWest Markets and pressure from shareholders to improve returns.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
